<d-title>
  <h1>SONIC-O1: Evaluating Multimodal AI on Real-World Audio-Video Understanding</h1>
  <p>
    <b>SO</b>cial <b>N</b>atural <b>I</b>nteraction <b>C</b>orpus (<b>O</b>mnimodal, v<b>1</b>) &mdash;
    A benchmark for evaluating how well AI systems understand real-world conversations
    through audio and video together.
  </p>
</d-title>
